{"name":"SkyAtmosphere","kind":"component","module":"render","doc":"A physical sky and aerial perspective lit by the scene&#39;s directional light. The sun&#39;s elevation sets the time of day; without this component the scene uses its <code>Environment</code> gradient. The first entity in ID order wins.","fields":[{"name":"seaLevel","typeHtml":"f32","doc":"World altitude of the planet surface (sea level); the sky and fog measure height from here.","default":"0","unit":"m"},{"name":"aerosols","typeHtml":"f32","doc":"Aerosol (haze, dust) density relative to clear Earth air. Raise it for dusty or humid skies: a whiter horizon, a wider sun glow and stronger aerial perspective.","default":"1","range":"0 – 20"},{"name":"cloudCoverage","typeHtml":"f32","doc":"Fraction of the sky covered by the lit cloud layer; 0 disables clouds.","default":"0","range":"0 – 1"},{"name":"cloudHeight","typeHtml":"f32","doc":"Altitude of the cloud layer above sea level.","default":"2200","unit":"m","range":"500 – 20000"}],"variants":[],"usedBy":{"types":[],"commands":[]},"usage":[{"label":"Add it","html":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">ara </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">do</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> component.add </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">-</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">p entity</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">name:Crate </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">-</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">p component</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">SkyAtmosphere </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">--</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">why </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-string)\">\"Add SkyAtmosphere\"</span></span></code></pre>"},{"label":"Set a field","html":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">ara </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">do</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> property.set </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">-</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">p entity</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">name:Crate </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">-</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">p path</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">SkyAtmosphere.seaLevel </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">-</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">p value</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-number)\">0</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> --</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">why </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-string)\">\"Tune SkyAtmosphere\"</span></span></code></pre>"},{"label":"In a scene document","html":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-property)\">  \"SkyAtmosphere\"</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-property)\">    \"seaLevel\"</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">: </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-number)\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">}</span></span></code></pre>"},{"label":"From C#","html":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-comment)\">/// &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-property)\">summary</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-comment)\">>Bring in clouds during a weather transition.&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-property)\">summary</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-comment)\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">public</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> static</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> void</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-function)\"> UseSkyAtmosphere</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">(</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-type)\">Entity</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> entity, </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">in</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-type)\"> Tick</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> tick)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">    ref</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> var</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> component </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> ref</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> World.</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-function)\">Get</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-type)\">SkyAtmosphere</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">>(entity);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">    component.CloudCoverage </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-number)\"> 0.7f</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">}</span></span></code></pre>"}],"csharp":"SkyAtmosphere"}
